.DS_Store

# Personal school documents - never publish these
*.pdf
timetable-private/

# Screenshots and photos dropped in the folder - never publish these
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
ChatGPT Image*.png
WhatsApp Image*


# ...except the app's own artwork, which is part of the build
!art/desk.jpg

# Source artwork dropped in the project root. The built icons in icons/ ship;
# the big originals they were made from don't need to be in a public repo.
/*.png

# ...and the bag artwork, which is part of the build
!art/bag/*.webp

# ...and the cork the reminders are pinned to
!art/cork.webp

# ...and the room the reminders are pinned up in
!art/wall.jpg
!art/shelf.jpg
!art/addnote.webp

# Design reference screenshots dropped in the folder - never publish these
Design_Issues_Fixed/
Design_Issues_Fixed.zip

# Settings reference pictures - never publish these
pictus to settings/

# ...and the settings screen's own art, which is part of the build
!art/set/*.webp

